No problem - are you looking to run NT on them or Linux..?
If NT, you'll need a head, etc but Linux would be fine without it.
You can use an IDE (IIRC) or SCSI HDD, a PC-flavoured floppy and
will need full parity (36-bit) RAM - it should have 6 RAM slots.

