: service manual we would be most thankful.

Ahh.. this one's trickier. If the remnants of http://workstation.digital.com
are still about, start there.

These machines will not run Tru64, nee Digital UNIX, nee OSF/1 nor will they
run OpenVMS.
Windoze NT 3.5x/4.0 or Linux are your options - I don't think *BSD made it
to the XL/XLTs.

