Folks,

I chatted with Acersoft this morning re: the emails (and duplicate emails)
that went out last week. The gist of the story is this: Acersoft compiled a
mailing list from people who filled out a request for further information on
Acersoft products, or who downloaded software from the site. The company is
not harvesting email addresses from visitors who drop by the site to browse
or download free back issues of Shannon Knows Compaq (in fact, they claim
they don't have the ability to do so even if they wanted to).

Those of you who received duplicate emails from Acersoft did so because of a
software problem (three guesses as to what OS was behind this!) which
resulted in a double-mailing.

