:We're thinking of putting a large (50Gb) disk on an Alpha workstation (600au)
:running OpenVMS 7.1-2.  The purpose is to hold archived data for access over
:the Internet.  The disk we have in mind is a Seagate ST150176LC or similar. 
:We've no idea if this will work under our version of VMS, though.  If it
