It should work fine as far as talking to a drive of that size, however,
you'll get a large (~100 blocks) cluster size by default.  Not a problem
if you plan to use a few large files, but lots of little ones will be.

V7.2 allows smaller cluster sizes on huge disks, you may want to consider
using it.  (This might be a V7.1 feature, I'll check...)

