I see no reason why it should not work. However you might consider to
upgrade to VMS 7.2-1, because older versions VMS support a maximum of 1
million clusters on a disk. This would mean that you would allocate
space for every file in chunks of 100 blocks, and that is a bit very
much. With 7.2-1 this 1 million cluster limit is gone. The maximum size
for a disk at present is more than 1 TB if I remember correctly.

Regards,

