The resource limts have a default value, a softlimit and a hardlimit.
The user is allowed to increase the value up to the softlimit.
The limits can be manipulated via the subsystem configuration
db (see sysconfigtab,  /sbin/sysconfig -q proc). The values are
described in the administrator Tuning guide. See also the
setrlimit(2) man page.

