	My point all along... Merced positioning .. lack thereof.  The 
	whole monkey wrench in this of course is AMD with Athlon.. I am
	sure Intel would like to scream.  Doing the math a 1 GHz Athlon
	should be near 40 SpecInt95.  Various attempts at reverse 
	engineering SpecInt95 in comp.arch puts Merced 35-45 SpecInt95
